{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, spacious "Urban Carry" product category section for my Shopify store.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    * Do NOT redesign the overall visual identity.
    * Keep the existing website's color palette, typography, spacing language, and minimalist aesthetic.
    * Do NOT add gradients, bright colors, shadows, borders, or decorative elements.
    * The design should feel natural, premium, modern, urban, smart, minimal, and functional.
    * The section must look like a professional leather goods brand website, not a generic ecommerce template.
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE:
    
    1. HEADER
       At the top center:
       "URBAN CARRY"
       Subtitle:
       "Carry smart. Move freely."
    
    Keep the heading and subtitle relatively compact and elegant.
    
    2. BAGS CATEGORY HEADER
       Create a horizontal row:
       Left:
       "BAGS"
    
    Right:
    "VIEW ALL"
    
    Use the existing website typography and colors.
    "VIEW ALL" should be subtle and elegant, not a large button.
    
    3. BAG CATEGORY CARDS
       Create 3 large visual category cards in one row on desktop:
    
    * Crossbody Bag
    * Backpack
    * Messenger Bag
    
    Each card should have:
    
    * A large image area
    * Category name underneath
    * A small "Explore →" text link
    
    The image area should be significantly larger than the current version. The main purpose of this section is visual discovery, so images should occupy most of the card.
    
    Use a clean editorial layout with generous spacing.
    
    CARD DESIGN:
    
    * No card shadows
    * No rounded excessive UI elements
    * No heavy borders
    * No product quantity controls
    * No "- 0 +" quantity selector
    * No price
    * No add-to-cart button
    * Keep the design minimal and editorial
    
    4. WALLETS CATEGORY
       Below the Bags section, create the same structure for:
    
    "WALLETS"                         "VIEW ALL"
    
    Then create 3 large visual category cards.
    
    Default wallet categories:
    
    * Card Holder
    * Wallet
    * Long Wallet
    
    Each should use the same visual treatment as the Bags cards.
    
    5. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
       Desktop:
    
    * 3 cards per row
    * Large image area
    * Generous whitespace
    
    Tablet:
    
    * 2 cards per row
    
    Mobile:
    
    * 1 card per row
    * Keep the images large
    * Maintain generous vertical spacing
    * Do not make the cards feel cramped
    
    6. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
       Make the block fully editable inside Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Allow the merchant to edit:
    
    * Section heading
    * Section subtitle
    * Bags title
    * Bags "View All" link
    * Wallets title
    * Wallets "View All" link
    * Each category image
    * Each category title
    * Each category link
    
    Allow merchants to add, remove, and reorder category cards using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each category should be an individual Shopify block.
    
    7. IMAGE BEHAVIOR
       Images should use a large, consistent aspect ratio.
       Use object-fit: cover or another appropriate crop that maintains a premium editorial appearance.
    
    Images should have subtle hover interaction:
    
    * Slight image scale on hover
    * Smooth transition
    * No dramatic animation
    
    8. SPACING
       The current section has too much empty space above the category names and not enough visual content.
    
    Reduce unnecessary empty whitespace while making the actual category images much larger.
    
    The section should feel balanced:
    Header → Bags → Large visual cards → Wallets → Large visual cards.
    
    Do not make the overall section excessively tall.
    
    9. IMPORTANT VISUAL DIRECTION
       Think:
       "Premium urban leather goods editorial website"
    
    Not:
    "Standard ecommerce product grid"
    
    The final result should communicate:
    Urban
    Modern
    Smart
    Minimal
    Functional
    Premium
    Leather goods
    
    Keep the existing Jack Studio design language intact.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}{% style %}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};background:{{ block.settings.background_color }}}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 4%}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{text-align:center;margin:0 auto {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:600}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subtitle{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:14px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group+ .urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group{margin-top:{{ block.settings.group_spacing }}px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group-title{margin:0;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.14em}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view,.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__explore{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:{{ block.settings.card_gap }}px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap{overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:{{ block.settings.image_ratio }};background:{{ block.settings.placeholder_color }}}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .45s ease}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover img{transform:scale(1.025)}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{height:100%;display:flex}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name{display:block;margin:16px 0 6px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:16px;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:989px){.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:600px){.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{padding:{{ block.settings.mobile_padding }}px 5%}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}.urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group+ .urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group{margin-top:64px}}{% endstyle %}<div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><header class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro"><h2 class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2><p class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subtitle">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p></header>{% for group in (1..2) %}{% if group == 1 %}{% assign group_title=block.settings.bags_title %}{% assign group_link=block.settings.bags_link %}{% assign start=1 %}{% else %}{% assign group_title=block.settings.wallets_title %}{% assign group_link=block.settings.wallets_link %}{% assign start=4 %}{% endif %}<section class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group"><div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group-header"><h3 class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group-title">{{ group_title }}</h3>{% if group_link != blank %}<a class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view" href="{{ group_link }}">VIEW ALL</a>{% endif %}</div><div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">{% for offset in (0..2) %}{% assign index=start | plus:offset %}{% assign image_key='image_' | append:index %}{% assign title_key='title_' | append:index %}{% assign link_key='link_' | append:index %}{% assign image=block.settings[image_key] %}{% assign title=block.settings[title_key] %}{% assign link=block.settings[link_key] %}<article class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><a href="{% if link != blank %}{{ link }}{% else %}#{% endif %}"><div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-wrap">{% if image %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width:1600 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</div><span class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name">{{ title }}</span><span class="urban-carry-{{ ai_gen_id }}__explore">Explore →</span></a></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>{% endfor %}</div></div>{% schema %}{"name":"Urban carry","tag":null,"class":"urban-carry-block","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"URBAN CARRY"},{"type":"text","id":"subtitle","label":"Subtitle","default":"Carry smart. Move freely."},{"type":"text","id":"bags_title","label":"Bags title","default":"BAGS"},{"type":"url","id":"bags_link","label":"Bags link"},{"type":"text","id":"wallets_title","label":"Wallets title","default":"WALLETS"},{"type":"url","id":"wallets_link","label":"Wallets link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_1","label":"Crossbody image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_1","label":"Crossbody title","default":"Crossbody Bag"},{"type":"url","id":"link_1","label":"Crossbody link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_2","label":"Backpack image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_2","label":"Backpack title","default":"Backpack"},{"type":"url","id":"link_2","label":"Backpack link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_3","label":"Messenger image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_3","label":"Messenger title","default":"Messenger Bag"},{"type":"url","id":"link_3","label":"Messenger link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_4","label":"Card holder image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_4","label":"Card holder title","default":"Card Holder"},{"type":"url","id":"link_4","label":"Card holder link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_5","label":"Wallet image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_5","label":"Wallet title","default":"Wallet"},{"type":"url","id":"link_5","label":"Wallet link"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_6","label":"Long wallet image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_6","label":"Long wallet title","default":"Long Wallet"},{"type":"url","id":"link_6","label":"Long wallet link"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":20,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":55},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_padding","label":"Mobile padding","min":16,"max":60,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":32},{"type":"range","id":"header_spacing","label":"Header spacing","min":24,"max":80,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":48},{"type":"range","id":"group_spacing","label":"Group spacing","min":40,"max":120,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"card_gap","label":"Card gap","min":8,"max":48,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":24},{"type":"select","id":"image_ratio","label":"Image ratio","options":[{"value":"1 / 1","label":"Square"},{"value":"4 / 5","label":"Portrait"},{"value":"3 / 4","label":"Tall portrait"}],"default":"4 / 5"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#F4EFDC"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#2B2420"},{"type":"color","id":"muted_color","label":"Muted text","default":"#7A7263"},{"type":"color","id":"placeholder_color","label":"Image placeholder","default":"#F9F4E3"}],"presets":[{"name":"Urban carry"}]}{% endschema %}